---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page title="Careers — Nairon" description="Join a small team in Miami deploying real AI employees for property management operators. Builders and first-principles thinkers welcome." eyebrow="Careers" heading="Build the AI workforce." intro="We are a small team building, running, and managing AI employees that do real operational work for property management operators. If you like owning outcomes end to end, we should talk.">
  <div class="page-body">

    <section class="page-section">
      <h2 class="page-section-title">How we work</h2>
      <p class="page-section-sub">A small team, close to the work and close to the customer.</p>
      <div class="page-grid cols-2">
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">Small team</div>
          <h3>High ownership</h3>
          <p>Few people, clear ownership. You take a problem from first contact with a customer through to a running AI employee in production. No layers between you and the outcome.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">Real outcomes</div>
          <h3>Ship work that runs</h3>
          <p>We do not ship demos. We build AI employees that handle permits, dispatch, resident requests, quoting, and follow-ups inside the tools a business already uses. Outcomes are measured.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">Close to customers</div>
          <h3>In the operator&rsquo;s world</h3>
          <p>We work inside property management operations — leasing, maintenance &amp; dispatch, and rent &amp; renewals. You will talk to the people doing the work, learn how their day runs, and design around what actually happens.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">Delivery model</div>
          <h3>Discover, Build, Tune, Enable</h3>
          <p>We run a proven four-step delivery model, built on more than 30 successful AI projects. No rip-and-replace migrations. Agents work in existing systems with scoped, audited access.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <h2 class="page-section-title">What we look for</h2>
      <p class="page-section-sub">The traits matter more than any specific title.</p>
      <div class="page-grid cols-3">
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">Builders</div>
          <h3>You make things</h3>
          <p>You have a track record of building and shipping. You would rather have a working version in front of a customer than a perfect plan on paper.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">First principles</div>
          <h3>You reason from the ground up</h3>
          <p>You break problems down to what is actually true, then design the simplest thing that works. You do not cargo-cult patterns or over-engineer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">Ambiguity</div>
          <h3>You are comfortable without a map</h3>
          <p>Early-stage work is unclear by nature. You can pick a direction with incomplete information, move, and correct as evidence comes in.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <h2 class="page-section-title">Open roles</h2>
      <p class="page-section-sub">We do not have formal openings posted right now.</p>
      <div class="page-prose">
        <p>We are always talking to exceptional builders, even when nothing is listed. If the work above sounds like what you want to do, we want to hear from you before a role exists on a page.</p>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@naironai.com">hello@naironai.com</a> and tell us what you would want to build here. Show us something you have made. We read every message and reply to the ones that fit.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:hello@naironai.com" style="align-items:center; background-color:#0f6bd4; border-radius:40px; color:#fff; display:inline-flex; font-family:'Geist',system-ui,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:500; gap:8px; margin-top:8px; padding:13px 24px; text-decoration:none;">Introduce yourself <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </section>

  </div>
</Page>
